 "transcript": [
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son reports to his father about his new wife.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) The second son reports to his father about his business.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"My elder brother says I am not to have that one and I am not to see her again, but I will see her, and she has promised to come to me next year.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What is all this?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What are you talking about?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I am talking about the woman, my father. She is a woman of wealth and beauty and I have asked for her hand in marriage and she has promised to be mine.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and now, I suppose you are asking for a woman with a good weight of silver and jewels as part of the dowry,\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"but I have no silver and jewels to give, for we are poor folk and I am an old man.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"You have the silver and jewels in your coffers, my father,\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"and I would have them as part of the dowry.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"My father, I will not marry without them,\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung tells his son he will not have the girl without the dowry.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son threatens to break with his father.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what then?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what then?\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"The thing is not to be done,\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung looks up at his eldest son and shrugs.",
  "[action] The second son looks at his brother.",
  "[action] The second son looks at his father."
